  "image": "/images/posts/11615.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Se desarrolló la cuarta versión del Encuentro de Cuidadores de Semillas en el sector de Tres Cumbres, iniciativa impulsada por el Programa Prodesal Maullín, que reunió a usuarios y usuarias del rubro agrícola de distintos sectores de la comuna.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🌿\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t1e/1/16/1f33f.png\"/> Durante la jornada se compartieron conocimientos sobre la conservación de variedades tradicionales que forman parte del patrimonio agrícola local, destacando:</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Cebolla chalota.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Habas mantequilla y arvejitas mantequilla.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Porotos pallares y variedades de distintos colores.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Papas nativas como guadacho blanca, guadacho azul y cabrita manchada.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Choclos, maíces antiguos y plantas medicinales.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👏\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfe/1/16/1f44f.png\"/> Este encuentro permite mantener vivos los saberes heredados, fortalecer la identidad rural y reconocer el valioso trabajo de quienes conservan nuestras semillas para las futuras generaciones.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/maull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZbeFzpqdAmYyD2RK-WavogFPPVeoRLHHOSWWamT03FJhPFXb6zMRxtPPkrdebq6bnT7RGqPq0uOOVGZln4CxSCswW6rFmuGVZH7RJu8JZiCKji5vfdHGW1tk8E4xtZdlOA020PNnopr8MVGLNKjcN-XCl1ClnJncUHhLBFn0a6KXwSuyfX5ILN2Pswn5Yrcr7M&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Maullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/prodesal?__cft__[0]=AZbeFzpqdAmYyD2RK-WavogFPPVeoRLHHOSWWamT03FJhPFXb6zMRxtPPkrdebq6bnT7RGqPq0uOOVGZln4CxSCswW6rFmuGVZH7RJu8JZiCKji5vfdHGW1tk8E4xtZdlOA020PNnopr8MVGLNKjcN-XCl1ClnJncUHhLBFn0a6KXwSuyfX5ILN2Pswn5Yrcr7M&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Prodesal</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/semillasancestrales?__cft__[0]=AZbeFzpqdAmYyD2RK-WavogFPPVeoRLHHOSWWamT03FJhPFXb6zMRxtPPkrdebq6bnT7RGqPq0uOOVGZln4CxSCswW6rFmuGVZH7RJu8JZiCKji5vfdHGW1tk8E4xtZdlOA020PNnopr8MVGLNKjcN-XCl1ClnJncUHhLBFn0a6KXwSuyfX5ILN2Pswn5Yrcr7M&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#SemillasAncestrales</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/patrimonioagr%C3%ADcola?__cft__[0]=AZbeFzpqdAmYyD2RK-WavogFPPVeoRLHHOSWWamT03FJhPFXb6zMRxtPPkrdebq6bnT7RGqPq0uOOVGZln4CxSCswW6rFmuGVZH7RJu8JZiCKji5vfdHGW1tk8E4xtZdlOA020PNnopr8MVGLNKjcN-XCl1ClnJncUHhLBFn0a6KXwSuyfX5ILN2Pswn5Yrcr7M&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#PatrimonioAgrícola</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/culturarural?__cft__[0]=AZbeFzpqdAmYyD2RK-WavogFPPVeoRLHHOSWWamT03FJhPFXb6zMRxtPPkrdebq6bnT7RGqPq0uOOVGZln4CxSCswW6rFmuGVZH7RJu8JZiCKji5vfdHGW1tk8E4xtZdlOA020PNnopr8MVGLNKjcN-XCl1ClnJncUHhLBFn0a6KXwSuyfX5ILN2Pswn5Yrcr7M&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#CulturaRural</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente comunicaciones munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11617\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/oqkpmcq6thum802/semiullas_06_1024x683_w8rbezpgqf.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-77 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11620\" data-id=\"11620\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/q4poy09vz970y52/semiullas_01_1024x683_gou3m0oiax.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11619\" data-id=\"11619\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/lp9k4cngawh36ex/semiullas_02_1024x683_b9s9dj3lze.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-11621\" data-id=\"11621\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"http